This project is a fork of https://github.com/aws-samples/bobs-used-bookstore-serverless
at commit 60705cc29dd8c4721a33348d047331fc8f38fb9a, licensed under MIT-0.

Modifications:
1. Fixed ListBooks passing a null cursor into an X-Ray annotation, which returned HTTP 502.
2. Defaulted an omitted pageSize instead of passing DynamoDB Limit=0, which returned HTTP 500.
3. Declared pageSize and cursor as query parameters on GET /books.
4. Hardened the read routes with AWS IAM authorization.
5. Removed the image-validation pipeline from the stack.
6. Stack-owned Lambda, API access-log, and API Gateway CloudWatch-role resources are deleted
   with the stack instead of being retained.
7. Upgraded the API projects and Lambda functions from .NET 8 to .NET 10 (dotnet10 runtime).
